{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>中美關係方面，中美元首會晤達成八點成果共識，內地傳將允許科企購買輝達新晶片。伊朗局勢方面，特朗普拒絕伊朗停火方案，料本周恢復談判。美日方面，兩國商討強勢日圓，上周五日圓升近百分之一。微軟創辦人蓋茨表示，AI強大到足以引發造成10億人死亡的事件。</p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>周二傳特朗普與科企開會商討AI，OpenAI開發者大會，同日為期結日。周三美國公布核心PCE及小非農ADP職位數據，中國公布PMI。周四聯儲局理事庫克等發表講話，港股休市。周五美國公布非農數據，達拉斯聯儲洛根發表演講。</p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin: 16px 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>繼AI巨頭呼籲放慢發展後，Oracle數據中心傳出「不可抗力」暫停，惹起AI基建融資及執行擔心。</p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style='text-align: left; margin-top: 16px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Open Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-bottom: 0px !important;'>短債ETF或者貨幣市場基金收息。高增長股方面，硬件可留意英特爾（INTC）、超微（AMD）、光通訊；電力相關可留意Bloom Energy（BE）、GE Vernova（GEV）、Caterpillar（CAT）、Vertiv（VRT）；測試設備可留意Teradyne（TER）、Aehr Test Systems（AEHR），需承受波動；面向消費者的AI（AI toC）可留意蘋果（AAPL）、Alphabet（GOOGL）、台積電（TSM）。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T01:39:52.703258+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}